{#
| Variable           | Type         | Description                              |
|--------------------|--------------|------------------------------------------|
| component          | object       | merchant settings from twilight.json     |
| component.items    | Collection[] | badges (icon, title, subtitle)           |
| item.icon          | string       | SallaIcons class `sicon-*`               |
| item.title         | string       | badge title                              |
| item.subtitle      | string       | badge subtitle                           |
| position           | int          | sorting block                            |

Figma: desktop 6036:1238 (1440) — 3 features in a row, vertical dividers.
       mobile  6036:22058 (428) — same features stacked, horizontal dividers.
Each feature (RTL): icon on the right, title + subtitle right-aligned to its left.
#}
<section class="s-block qtb" id="qtb-{{ position }}">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="qtb__strip">
            {% for i, item in component.items %}
                {% if i > 0 %}<span class="qtb__divider" aria-hidden="true"></span>{% endif %}
                <div class="qtb__feature">
                    {% if item.icon %}
                        <span class="qtb__icon"><i class="{{ item.icon }}"></i></span>
                    {% endif %}
                    <div class="qtb__content">
                        {% if item.title %}<span class="qtb__title">{{ item.title }}</span>{% endif %}
                        {% if item.subtitle %}<span class="qtb__subtitle">{{ item.subtitle }}</span>{% endif %}
                    </div>
                </div>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
